{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_title", "source_sha256": "7dc7215e7e906512e8cf7095411e0269b30af74ce7441370b90b81df71135efe", "ja": "心のエコロケーション", "zh": "心灵的回声定位", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cee7126f93dc68e6949aa6bc96178f2b6957c164155f6d3220588745d147aa4e", "ja": "水族館でイルカショーをすることになった\n『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』の3人。\nイルカと仲良くなるにはどうしたらいいか\n分からないと悩むやよいに、響と春香は\n相手の気持ちを考えるのが大切だと伝えた。", "zh": "『钻石潜水员◇』的3名成员要在水族馆进行海豚表演了。\n对于不知道该如何和海豚搞好关系而烦恼的弥生，响和春香告诉她，设身处地考虑对方的心情很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "8b2c985661e198b297ac92cb4af3c6ac3780d79b59a46a322c827e4c5fbdcc44", "ja": "えへへ。また私達『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』の\n3人で、一緒に水族館のお仕事ができるんだね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。没想到我们『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』的3个人还能一起在水族馆工作呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "848eda5d7a3320d55d6b1dcfa3ef1c911fa32fec96e3845b9d3772d57188ab62", "ja": "まさか自分たちがイルカショーをやらせてもらえる\nなんて、思わなかったぞ！", "zh": "真没想到居然能让我们来表演海豚秀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "b65b14e7d4b781c2a9215df41506029aef71bb3d5466d8f5f60666014d9d7f80", "ja": "うっうー！　イルカと遊ぶの、楽しみです！\nみんなで素敵なショーにしましょ～！", "zh": "呜呜—！能和海豚一起玩，好期待呀！\n大家一起办一场精彩的表演吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "af2445db65939b6ef3c70aaee64042a29190b881441d46a30755249802377c43", "ja": "もちろんだぞ！\n今日の練習も、いっぱい頑張るさー！", "zh": "当然啦！今天的练习也要努力——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "904d8f0b0f21ca012e275ffcdcdf7eb8517641e2cdc378e583bf2cc818ad250e", "ja": "そうだね。この前のコラボも\n評判良かったって褒めてもらえたし！", "zh": "是啊。之前的合作也受到了好评，还被夸奖了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "240f4be050b7e8af026912a057f5c68913457f0e396115113886aeb98a591370", "ja": "それに、しっかり練習しないと、\n私、本番で焦って転んじゃうかも。", "zh": "而且，要是不认真练习，我说不定会在正式演出时慌慌张张摔倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "f596d72e9a6c44f552a1e7a23fe0e6d880a6e664352501d409f86cb18f019291", "ja": "プールサイドって、滑りやすいですもんね。そのまま\n水にバシャーンって、落ちちゃうかもしれないですし。", "zh": "泳池边很容易滑倒嘛。说不定还会就这样“哗啦”一声掉进水里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "66a3a22bf2fa643a91426baf0a27bcf96e3f49ad8a17c33e116c9d0ba54a7219", "ja": "それなら大丈夫だぞ。イルカは優しいから、\nきっと背中に乗せて助けてくれるさー！", "zh": "那样就没问题了。海豚很温柔，一定会让你骑到背上，把你救起来的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "b45a8f1efc18e20b33dd4c71e47e3f255fc19b6dddb8c96fc18d9df933d490aa", "ja": "あはは……。でも、イルカに迷惑かけちゃうから、\nそうならないように気を付けるね。", "zh": "啊哈哈……可是，这样会给海豚添麻烦的，所以我会注意不让这种事发生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "3a0bd1c2e177b4681835a8e88b45cbd5e906f9fd61f6dbda9248bbf90898ab9b", "ja": "練習できるのって今日だけだから、\nちゃんと覚えないと。", "zh": "因为今天是唯一能练习的机会，所以一定要好好记住才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "85fd476d9614bc7d1f6415ce9e4d99bd33ec8a44ffa066906e17f1eb770b5eba", "ja": "そうですよね。それに私、\n今日のうちにイルカとお友達になりたいです！", "zh": "是啊。而且我还想在今天之内和海豚成为朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "3039f4686603cf60cd7065b9e5dbcbb9ec5ba456c00b9c72b165ddced22c021e", "ja": "そっか、イルカと気持ちが通じ合えば、\nきっとショーもうまくいくよね。", "zh": "这样啊，只要能和海豚心意相通，表演一定也能顺利进行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "d2efd1d0df35383091a65ceb4c5395d119d24f1876a46797d6debe84aafff231", "ja": "はいっ！　でも、どうやったら\n仲良くなれるか分からなくって……。", "zh": "是！可是，我不知道该怎么和它们搞好关系……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "fa644259659123489395b980e9db6003547430f8cb0f9e1b8a752127cc8b123d", "ja": "響さんは、沖縄に仲良しのイルカがいたんですよね？\nどうやって仲良くなったんですか？", "zh": "响，你在冲绳有关系很好的海豚，对吧？是怎么和它们熟悉起来的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "b6ded24d8ccd8dfdc220e409caec7d2f0f61320d0715a0751ab7f97d5147ec12", "ja": "イル代のこと？　う～ん……。", "zh": "是说小伊代吗？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "1febc19e0d91218f9f0d897b8979940d8de2c7916c15de4cdee157eb70099288", "ja": "自分、気が付いたら一緒に泳いでたから、\nどうして仲良くなれたかよく分からないぞ？", "zh": "我回过神来就已经和它一起游泳了，所以也不太清楚为什么会变得这么要好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "9b1cca8d8212bf7a9374be4404a16487444abf4e341522d97c1001b7e89a3eca", "ja": "響ちゃんは普段から動物と仲良しだから、\n自然にそうなれたってことなのかな？", "zh": "响平时就和动物关系很好，所以才会自然而然地变成那样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "cb4dea4765595d28e1971ad722e80a7ee17dc1301a99e6c0599cf169cd82e054", "ja": "う～ん……。でもそれだと、\n私には難しそうです～……。", "zh": "嗯……可是那样的话，对我来说好像很难呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "cdf0610cde5ca4605424565454341f5d2166498955a3325771dce1cfb0dd72be", "ja": "イルカと一緒にご飯を食べたらいいのかなぁ……。\nだって、一緒にお食事すると仲良くなれますよね？", "zh": "要是和海豚一起吃饭就好了吧……。\n因为一起吃饭的话，就能变得要好了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "ddaeae71a0fb4e867d4bf6b2f04e188acb60314806d2b4d7b847a464fdbfeb02", "ja": "え～っ！　自分達も、\nバケツいっぱいのイワシを食べるの～！？", "zh": "诶——！我们也要吃满满一桶沙丁鱼吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "b476d5990ed15164d5069611f04ca7cb1bc1a1645f97b929952f0139eb79ff37", "ja": "えーと……私達は、私達用のご飯を食べれば\nいいんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "那个……我们吃我们自己的饭就好了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "7af39f493e499fefe3298837e738a2ab841c7bcf03b169ef8bdbd110e0cf5054", "ja": "それなら私、\n今からお弁当作っちゃいますね！", "zh": "那我现在就来做便当吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "28b61929c8fb3d5c4cce8b150d8c4edab254c93189bf1694870aeb15bfa23502", "ja": "あっ、待って、やよい！\nもうすぐ練習始まっちゃうぞ！", "zh": "啊，等等，弥生！\n马上就要开始练习了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "ba9a6aa56c9cc9c253f56ecfab55bdd49be11ab1bd108f6261c2adf2e6d99c18", "ja": "うう……そうでした……。\nそんな時間、なかったですね……。", "zh": "呜呜……对哦……。\n根本就没有那种时间呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "b1db49d7478d93ea956f2072c33431584d3d73b70c69919900be38ed69f4d147", "ja": "落ち込まなくてもいいさー！　どうやったら\n仲良くなれるか考えるのは、いいことだぞ。", "zh": "不用沮丧啦！想想怎么才能\n跟对方打好关系，这是好事呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "cc59a0ad781201d06b0a9e6893f8da5862731058415de4ea701d0800ff6ef5ca", "ja": "そういうのって、大切だよね。相手が自分のことを\n考えてくれてるってだけで、距離が近くなるもん。", "zh": "这种想法很重要，对吧。只要想到对方正在为自己着想，彼此的距离就会拉近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "c2231fd7b465cb6cc603e568dec350569fa4a42dc3f8cc483d084936dc571f84", "ja": "そうそう。だから、イルカのことをもっと考えると\nいいと思うぞ。どんなこと考えてるのかな～……とか。", "zh": "对对。所以，我觉得多想想海豚的事会比较好。比如说，它们都在想些什么呢～……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "41d306f2cca1e0c4cec118228cf04b5097475babaf1065ccd61cfb33a903f90c", "ja": "イルカの考えていること、ですか……。\nあっ、私、それなら分かるかもしれないです！", "zh": "海豚在想什么吗……  \n啊，要是这个的话，我说不定能明白！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "4ea553bf271b90da80d6788b320c426334e20b0556f3a3dec977c392d6245451", "ja": "きっとイルカ達は、ショーを見にきてくれた\nお客さんに、楽しんでもらいたいんだって思います！", "zh": "我想，海豚们一定是希望来看表演的客人能够开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "e1c5defe2f0ae9862a903c649439d8a6520e326a192cb5fb32a9aa3238a36e4c", "ja": "そっか！　それって、自分達がステージに立ってる時と\n同じ気持ちってことだよね！　すごいぞ、やよい！", "zh": "原来如此！也就是说，这和我们站在舞台上时的心情是一样的吧！好厉害啊，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "8d611fcd1c64f2ba0310f7bb5c893a2468b4a881081f780e193535644865130e", "ja": "えへへへ～♪　だから、前に見たショーも、\nあんなに楽しかったんじゃないかなーって！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿～♪所以，我想之前看过的表演也会那么开心，应该就是因为这个吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_025_dd_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_025_dd_01_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "171ab0008143464957f885602108a9759c65c6b1588697c171827c4634cbc418", "ja": "うふふっ……。そういうふうに考えたら、\nイルカ達もアイドルなのかもしれないね。", "zh": "呵呵呵……这么一想的话，\n海豚们说不定也是偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
